The graphical interface of UMD, set aside (November 2026, after version 2.10)

UMD_GUI.py           the PyQt5 interface (2023)
averages_forGUI.py   averages of a field, as the GUI expects them
val_extract_umd.py   values of a field snapshot by snapshot, for the GUI plots

These files are not maintained and do not run. UMD_GUI.py imports modules
removed from src/ during the cleanup of 2026; their replacements are:
  VaspParser2umd          -> VaspParser.py
  umd_to_lammps           -> umd2out.py -r lammps
  umd2poscar              -> umd2out.py -r poscar
  umd2xyz                 -> umd2out.py -r xyz
  MSDdistrib              -> msd_umd.py -a tensor -p ...
and the options and outputs of the other scripts it calls have changed since.

The analysis is done with the scripts of src/ (see the README and
documentation/umd-quick-help.pdf), or all at once with src/umd_workflow.py.
